WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.870
After submission,

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.580
polish the listing before it goes live.

3
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.040
In Settings, check reservations,

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.943
fees, the no-show policy,

5
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.732
and the weekly hours.

6
00:00:13.921 --> 00:00:16.840
Name, address or category changes

7
00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.805
go through Request a change.

8
00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.149
To update Sunday, open its closing time,

9
00:00:22.149 --> 00:00:23.414
choose ten at night,

10
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.877
then confirm twenty-two hundred

11
00:00:28.955 --> 00:00:30.486
and save the hours.

12
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:34.807
Next, open Edit photos and details.

13
00:00:35.656 --> 00:00:37.068
In Deck readiness,

14
00:00:37.068 --> 00:00:39.658
check that the video cover is strong

15
00:00:39.723 --> 00:00:41.400
and the gallery has at least

16
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.345
five clear venue photos.

17
00:00:44.747 --> 00:00:46.490
Add the public website

18
00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:48.648
and confirm the typical spend:

19
00:00:48.804 --> 00:00:51.612
twenty-five to seventy-five dollars.

20
00:00:52.047 --> 00:00:54.807
Answer every quick question honestly.

21
00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.657
These choices tell Mingla

22
00:00:56.657 --> 00:00:58.230
what guests can expect,

23
00:00:58.347 --> 00:00:59.510
from groups,

24
00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.756
live music and reservations

25
00:01:01.947 --> 00:01:03.917
to meals, drinks,

26
00:01:03.924 --> 00:01:05.549
vegetarian options

27
00:01:05.549 --> 00:01:07.171
and service types.

28
00:01:07.547 --> 00:01:09.591
Then save the profile

29
00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:14.451
and wait for the Changes

30
00:01:14.451 --> 00:01:15.589
saved confirmation.

31
00:01:17.647 --> 00:01:19.999
The listing stays In review

32
00:01:20.059 --> 00:01:21.835
while Mingla checks it.

33
00:01:22.559 --> 00:01:24.964
After approval, return Home

34
00:01:24.964 --> 00:01:27.794
and reopen Lantern Room from Recent.

35
00:01:28.647 --> 00:01:31.413
The green Live on Mingla badge

36
00:01:31.413 --> 00:01:33.316
confirms it is public.

37
00:01:33.430 --> 00:01:35.047
Open the preview and check

38
00:01:35.047 --> 00:01:36.212
the video cover,

39
00:01:36.246 --> 00:01:38.064
gallery, category,

40
00:01:38.064 --> 00:01:40.060
city, title,

41
00:01:40.169 --> 00:01:41.529
typical spend,

42
00:01:41.591 --> 00:01:43.059
current status,

43
00:01:43.124 --> 00:01:45.062
and Booking Available.

44
00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:46.887
Read the recommendation,

45
00:01:46.954 --> 00:01:49.428
then scroll to verify the map,

46
00:01:49.431 --> 00:01:50.344
address,

47
00:01:51.347 --> 00:01:52.832
and weekly hours.

48
00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:56.593
Sunday now closes at ten,

49
00:01:57.747 --> 00:02:00.490
and Reserve a table is ready for guests.
